title: A file of 12000 lines is one long column: going to its end, hovering and clicking in the last lines work, and typing on line 11990 lands exactly there
folders: odd-files
limit: 70
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: nothing offers
expect-file: odd-files/big.rs :: (?s)\npub fn f11988\(\) -> usize \{ 11988 \}\nXpub fn f11989\(\) -> usize \{ 11989 \}\npub fn f11990\(\)

wait 3500
goto big.rs
wait 2000
mark a-top-of-the-column
wait 450
where
tool edit
edit big.rs 11990 1
wait 1500
mark b-line-11990
wait 450
where
hover big.rs 11995 5
wait 600
mark c-hover-near-the-end
wait 450
type X
wait 600
key save
wait 1500
mark d-saved
wait 450
quit
